{"cwd":"/Users/user/Projects/myproject-a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"content":[{"text":"Ran 4 subagents in parallel (x402 lens, ERC-8004 lens, myproject-a/Solana lens, implementation/security lens).  \nOverall verdict: **Not ready for implementation**.\n\n1. **Critical: hash/signature model is incompatible with myproject-a**\n- Current spec uses `dataHash = keccak256(len||request||response)` and `interactionHash = keccak256(taskRef||dataHash)` in `/Users/user/Projects/otherrepo-1/specs/extensions/8004-reputation.md:260`, `/Users/user/Projects/otherrepo-1/specs/extensions/8004-reputation.md:261`, `/Users/user/Projects/otherrepo-1/specs/extensions/8004-reputation.md:307`, `/Users/user/Projects/otherrepo-1/specs/extensions/8004-reputation.md:308`.\n- myproject-a defines `data_hash = keccak256(request||response)` and domain+schema-separated interaction hash in `/Users/user/Projects/myproject-a/docs/specification.md:39`, `/Users/user/Projects/myproject-a/docs/specification.md:250`, `/Users/user/Projects/myproject-a/docs/specification.md:335`, `/Users/user/Projects/myproject-a/packages/sdk/src/hashes.ts:49`, `/Users/user/Projects/myproject-a/packages/sdk/src/hashes.ts:179`.\n- **Impact:** Solana/myproject-a verification fails.\n- **Fix:** Align formulas to myproject-a (domain + schema + canonical taskRef + dataHash).\n\n2. **High: aggregator request cannot deterministically pick reputation registry**\n- Registry pair is declared (`agentRegistry` + `reputationRegistry`) in `/Users/user/Projects/otherrepo-1/specs/extensions/8004-reputation.md:148`.\n- Aggregator request payload omits `reputationRegistry` in `/Users/user/Projects/otherrepo-1/specs/extensions/8004-reputation.md:613`, while aggregator is required to call the right reputation registry in `/Users/user/Projects/otherrepo-1/specs/extensions/8004-reputation.md:666`.\n- **Impact:** ambiguous routing in two-registry deployments.\n- **Fix:** include `reputationRegistry` (and/or explicit derivation rule) in aggregator payload.\n\n3. **High: reviewer signature encoding is not ERC-8004 compatible**\n- Spec signs `value` as `uint16_be(value)` in `/Users/user/Projects/otherrepo-1/specs/extensions/8004-reputation.md:524`.\n- ERC-8004 feedback value is signed fixed-point `int128` (supports negative values) in `/Users/user/Projects/otherrepo-3/ERC8004SPEC.md:206`, `/Users/user/Projects/otherrepo-3/ERC8004SPEC.md:214`, `/Users/user/Projects/otherrepo-3/ERC8004SPEC.md:243`.\n- **Impact:** negative/high-precision values are not representable/portable.\n- **Fix:** encode `value` as signed wide integer (e.g., int128 BE) and define exact serialization.\n\n4. **High: replay/forgery controls are underspecified in aggregator flow**\n- Security requires transaction validation in `/Users/user/Projects/otherrepo-1/specs/extensions/8004-reputation.md:712`, but aggregator requirements don’t define canonical `taskRef` resolution/dedup logic in `/Users/user/Projects/otherrepo-1/specs/extensions/8004-reputation.md:661`.\n- **Impact:** inconsistent implementations; replay/fabricated taskRef risk.\n- **Fix:** normative verification steps for CAIP-220 resolution + dedup key + rejection behavior.\n\n5. **Medium: value semantics are overly constrained for ERC-8004**\n- feedbackURI defines `value` as “0-100” in `/Users/user/Projects/otherrepo-1/specs/extensions/8004-reputation.md:496`.\n- **Impact:** narrows ERC-8004 scoring model unnecessarily.\n- **Fix:** describe `value/valueDecimals` per ERC-8004 numeric model, and treat 0-100 as optional convention/tag profile.\n\n6. **Medium: conformance details are missing**\n- Error codes are listed but not behaviorally specified in `/Users/user/Projects/otherrepo-1/specs/extensions/8004-reputation.md:657`.\n- No canonical test vectors for hash/signature serialization paths rooted at `/Users/user/Projects/otherrepo-1/specs/extensions/8004-reputation.md:258` and `/Users/user/Projects/otherrepo-1/specs/extensions/8004-reputation.md:518`.\n- **Fix:** add status-code