{"cwd":"/Users/user/Projects/myproject-a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"content":[{"text":"I’m mapping each of your documented resolutions (Q1–Q7 plus later follow-ups) to the exact blockers and checking what remains unresolved in the current spec text. I’ll return a strict solved/partial/not-solved matrix.","type":"text"}],"role":"assistant","type":"message"},"parentUuid":"019c6c57-e2a9-7373-802e-dfcba907221b:000213","sessionId":"019c6c57-e2a9-7373-802e-dfcba907221b","timestamp":"2026-02-17T23:40:14.637Z","type":"assistant","userType":"external","uuid":"019c6c57-e2a9-7373-802e-dfcba907221b:000215"}
