{"cwd":"/Users/user/Projects/myproject-a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"content":[{"text":"Short answer: **mostly no**. Your resolutions improve the spec, but they do **not fully resolve** the blockers I identified.\n\n1. **myproject-a hash/signature compatibility (Critical): `Partial`**\n- Your Q1 proposal fixes one part by using `keccak(request||response)` in `2602-17-pr-1024-discussion.md:187`.\n- But it still defines `interactionHash = keccak(taskRef||dataHash)` in `2602-17-pr-1024-discussion.md:189`, which does not match myproject-a’s domain+schema construction in `myproject-a/docs/specification.md:39` and `myproject-a/docs/specification.md:335`.\n- Also, current spec text still uses length-prefixed `dataHash` in `otherrepo-1/specs/extensions/8004-reputation.md:264`.\n\n2. **Aggregator routing to correct `reputationRegistry` (High): `Not solved`**\n- Your aggregator payload proposal uses `{ paymentResponse, review... }` in `2602-17-pr-1024-discussion.md:237`, but no deterministic registry routing rule is added.\n- Current aggregator request still lacks `reputationRegistry` in `otherrepo-1/specs/extensions/8004-reputation.md:633`.\n\n3. **Reviewer value encoding vs ERC-8004 `int128` (High): `Not solved`**\n- I don’t see a resolution in the discussion for signed-wide value serialization.\n- Current spec still uses `uint16_be(value)` in `otherrepo-1/specs/extensions/8004-reputation.md:542`, conflicting with ERC-8004 value semantics in `otherrepo-3/ERC8004SPEC.md:206` and `otherrepo-3/ERC8004SPEC.md:214`.\n\n4. **Replay/taskRef verification rigor (High): `Partial`**\n- You acknowledged facilitator-side settlement validation conceptually in `2602-17-pr-1024-discussion.md:248`.\n- But no normative algorithm/dedup semantics were defined; current spec still has high-level MUST text only in `otherrepo-1/specs/extensions/8004-reputation.md:712`.\n\n5. **Value semantics constrained to 0–100 (Medium): `Not solved`**\n- Current spec still says “Feedback score (0-100)” in 