{"cwd":"/Users/user/Projects/myproject-a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"content":[{"text":"Reviewed `otherrepo-6/docs/x402-reputation-extension-context/8004-reputation-spec-issues.md` line-by-line.\n\nVerdict: **these resolutions address most of the issues**, but not all are fully closed yet.\n\n1. **Hash model mismatch with myproject-a** (`F-1`, `:13-62`)  \nStatus: **Partial / conditional**.  \nThis is resolved only if you accept the explicit strategy: x402 uses its own formula and myproject-a adds `FeedbackX402V1` later (`:50-62`). It does **not** give immediate compatibility with current myproject-a on-chain verification.\n\n2. **Aggregator routing ambiguity** (`F-8`, `:222-329`)  \nStatus: **Solved (with assumptions)**.  \nYour `feedbackAggregator { url, settlementChain }` + deriving registry per chain fixes the routing gap. Caveat: depends on singleton-registry assumptions (`:245-247`).\n\n3. **Reviewer encoding (`uint16`) vs ERC-8004 `int128`** (`F-3`, `:96-108`)  \nStatus: **Solved**.  \n`int128_be` is the right fix.\n\n4. **TaskRef timing / tx binding** (`F-5`, `:124-145`)  \nStatus: **Solved**.  \nUsing `onAfterSettle` with synchronous settlement closes the txHash availability gap.\n\n5. **Replay/dedup controls** (`F-9`, `:330-357`)  \nStatus: **Partial**.  \n`SHOULD` dedup is better than nothing, but it’s weaker than the stronger anti-replay guarantees we flagged.\n\n6. **Client failure behavior undefined** (`F-10`, `:359-386`)  \nStatus: **Solved**.  \nClear degradation policy is now defined.\n\n7. **Encoding ambiguities** (`F-6`, `:150-186`)  \nStatus: **Mostly solved**.  \nThe explicit encoding table is strong and addresses most interoperability concerns.\n\n8. **No test vectors** (`F-11`, `:391-394`)  \nStatus: **Not solved yet**.  \nThis remains the biggest remaining implementation risk.\n\nOverall: **good resolution set**, but implementation-readiness still depends on finishing `F-11` and explicitly documenting the myproject-a Phase 1/Phase 2 compatibility boundary in the spec text.","type":"text"}],"role":"assistant","type":"message"},"parentUuid":"019c6c57-e2a9-7373-802e-dfcba907221b:000258","sessionId":"019c6c57-e2a9-7373-802e-dfcba907221b","timestamp":"2026-02-18T00:35:02.881Z","type":"assistant","userType":"external","uuid":"019c6c57-e2a9-7373-802e-dfcba907221b:000260"}
